igned for those who want only the best in a nutritional drink."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Available in three easy-to-mix flavors, Precision Engineered(R) Whey Protein is the perfect complement to your exercise schedule."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"For an extra treat, blend with fruit or your favorite non-fat frozen yogurt."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Servings Per Container about 38 about 19"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS: For adults, add one (1) scoop (24 g) to 8 fl. ounces of water or your favorite beverage. Mix in your Precision Engineered(R) shaker or a blender and drink immediately for best results. You can drink Precision Engineered(R) Whey Protein any time during the day to add extra high quality protein to your daily calorie intake. Be sure to figure the extra calories provided by milk, juice or whatever you may add to your Precision Engineered(R) Whey Protein. Increase or decrease the amount of liquid added to achieve desired consistency."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains milk and soy ingredients."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"HIGH IN PROTEIN\nHIGH CONCENTRATION OF BRANCHED CHAIN AMINO ACIDS FROM PROTEIN"},{"type":"Formula re: Type","notes":"Whey is popular with bodybuilders, people on high protein diets, and anyone looking for a quick, easy-to-use nutritional drink."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Whey is a natural by-product of milk, and is loaded with amino acids, the building blocks of protein, which play a role in optimal nutrition.* Whey naturally contains branched chain amino acids – made up of Leucine, Isoleucine and Valine. These nutrients are important components of muscle tissue.*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Use in conjunction with an intense daily exercise program and a balanced diet including an adequate caloric intake."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"No fructose added to this product.  Not a low calorie product.\nContents are sold by weight. Some settling may occur."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"(C) 2012 Precision Engineered Limited (USA)"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"PRECISION ENGINEERED(R) HARDCORE SERIES"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Whey Protein Powder"},{"type":"Formula re: Type","notes":"PROTEIN BASED SOURCE OF HIGH QUALITY NUTRITION A GREAT CHOICE FOR ATHLETES OR THOSE ON HIGH PROTEIN DIETS"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"• HIGH IN BCAAs FROM PROTEIN • INSTANTIZED FOR EASY MIXING • EASY TO ASSIMILATE"},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Not intended for use by persons under the age of 18. Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store at room temperature."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if seal under cap is broken or missing."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Precision Engineered has pioneered the manufacture of premium sports nutrition supplements. Our commitment to quality is the highest in our industry. Every product undergoes rigorous analysis for purity, potency, safety and freshness. We guarantee it."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"QA QUALITY ASSURED"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No Artificial Color, No Preservatives, No Gluten, No Wheat, No Yeast, No Fish."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"WARNING: If you are pregnant, nursing, taking any medications or have any medical condition, consult your doctor before use."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"• 94% LACTOSE FREE"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"• ASPARTAME-FREE"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"DIETARY SUPPLEMENT"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"NOTICE: Use this product as a food supplement only. Do not use for weight reduction."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NATURALLY & ARTIFICIALLY FLAVORED"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use and consult your doctor if any adverse reactions occur."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Precision Engineered(R) Whey Protein is a high quality, premium whey protein which is a natural source of glycomacropeptides."},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"PROD. #2694 B66632 16G"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2014-01-24","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":284519,"description":null,"notes":null,"quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":24,"operator":"=","quantity":90,"unit":"{Calories}","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"},{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":48,"operator":"=","quantity":190,"unit":"{Calories}","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedRows":[{"order":2,"ingredientId":284522,"description":null,"notes":null,"quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":24,"operator":"=","quantity":20,"unit":"{Calories}","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"},{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":48,"operator":"=","quantity":35,"unit":"{Calories}","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedRow